{"task_id": "Mbpp/7", "solution": "def find_char_long(input_string: str) -> set[str]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds all words in a string that are at least 4 characters long.\n    Splits the string by whitespace, filters based on length, and returns unique words.\n    \"\"\"\n    words = input_string.split()\n    result_set = set()\n    for word in words:\n        if len(word) >= 4:\n            result_set.add(word)\n    return result_set"}
