{"task_id": "Mbpp/69", "solution": "def is_sublist(main_list: list, sublist: list) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if a sublist exists as a contiguous sequence of elements within a main list.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not sublist:\n        return True\n    if not main_list:\n        return False\n\n    n = len(main_list)\n    m = len(sublist)\n\n    if m > n:\n        return False\n\n    for i in range(n - m + 1):\n        if main_list[i : i + m] == sublist:\n            return True\n    return False"}
