{"task_id": "Mbpp/74", "solution": "def is_samepatterns(sequence: list[str], pattern: list[str]) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if a sequence of strings follows a specified pattern.\n\n    Args:\n        sequence: The input sequence of strings.\n        pattern: The pattern to match against.\n\n    Returns:\n        True if the sequence follows the pattern, False otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(sequence) != len(pattern):\n        return False\n\n    seq_to_pattern_map = {}\n    pattern_to_seq_map = {}\n\n    for i in range(len(sequence)):\n        seq_char = sequence[i]\n        pattern_char = pattern[i]\n\n        if seq_char in seq_to_pattern_map:\n            if seq_to_pattern_map[seq_char] != pattern_char:\n                return False\n        else:\n            seq_to_pattern_map[seq_char] = pattern_char\n\n        if pattern_char in pattern_to_seq_map:\n            if pattern_to_seq_map[pattern_char] != seq_char:\n                return False\n        else:\n            pattern_to_seq_map[pattern_char] = seq_char\n\n    return True"}
