{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "def sequence(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the nth number of the Newman-Conway sequence using memoization.\"\"\"\n    memo = [0, 1, 1]  # P(0) is unused, P(1)=1, P(2)=1\n\n    if n < len(memo):\n        return memo[n]\n\n    for i in range(len(memo), n + 1):\n        p_n_minus_1 = memo[i - 1]\n        \n        term1_index = p_n_minus_1\n        term2_index = i - p_n_minus_1\n        \n        term1 = memo[term1_index]\n        term2 = memo[term2_index]\n        \n        memo.append(term1 + term2)\n        \n    return memo[n]"}
