{"task_id": "Mbpp/131", "solution": "def reverse_vowels(s: str) -> str:\n    VOWELS = {'a', 'e', 'i', 'o', 'u'}\n\n    def _is_vowel(char: str) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Checks if a character is a vowel (case-insensitive, 'y' excluded).\"\"\"\n        return char.lower() in VOWELS\n\n    char_list = list(s)\n    vowel_indices = []\n    extracted_vowels = []\n\n    # Identify and extract vowels, storing their original indices.\n    for i, char in enumerate(char_list):\n        if _is_vowel(char):\n            vowel_indices.append(i)\n            extracted_vowels.append(char)\n\n    # Reverse the order of the extracted vowels.\n    reversed_vowels = extracted_vowels[::-1]\n\n    # Replace vowels in the character list with their reversed counterparts.\n    for j, original_vowel_index in enumerate(vowel_indices):\n        char_list[original_vowel_index] = reversed_vowels[j]\n\n    return \"\".join(char_list)"}
