{"task_id": "Mbpp/137", "solution": "def zero_count(array: list[int]) -> float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the ratio of zero elements to non-zero elements in an array of integers.\n    Handles edge cases for division by zero, returning float('nan') or float('inf').\n    \"\"\"\n    zero_elements = 0\n    non_zero_elements = 0\n\n    for x in array:\n        if x == 0:\n            zero_elements += 1\n        else:\n            non_zero_elements += 1\n\n    if non_zero_elements == 0:\n        if zero_elements == 0:\n            return float('nan') # 0/0\n        else:\n            return float('inf') # X/0 where X > 0\n    else:\n        return zero_elements / non_zero_elements"}
