{"task_id": "Mbpp/265", "solution": "def list_split(input_list: list, n: int) -> list[list]:\n    \"\"\"Splits an input list into `n` sublists based on index modulo `n`. Raises ValueError if `n` is not positive.\"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"n must be positive\")\n\n    result = [[] for _ in range(n)]\n    for index, element in enumerate(input_list):\n        target_sublist_index = index % n\n        result[target_sublist_index].append(element)\n\n    return result"}
