{"task_id": "Mbpp/294", "solution": "def max_val(input_list: list) -> int | float | None:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the maximum numeric value in a heterogeneous list.\n    Filters out non-numeric elements and returns the maximum among the remaining numeric values.\n    Returns None if no numeric values are found in the list.\n    \"\"\"\n    def _filter_numeric_elements(input_list: list) -> list[int | float]:\n        \"\"\"\n        Filters a list, returning a new list containing only numeric elements (int or float).\n        \"\"\"\n        numeric_elements = []\n        for item in input_list:\n            if isinstance(item, (int, float)):\n                numeric_elements.append(item)\n        return numeric_elements\n\n    numeric_values = _filter_numeric_elements(input_list)\n\n    if not numeric_values:\n        return None\n    else:\n        return max(numeric_values)"}
