{"task_id": "Mbpp/297", "solution": "def flatten_list(nested_list: list) -> list:\n    \"\"\"\n    Recursively flattens a nested list structure into a single-level list containing only primitive values.\n    Preserves the order of elements from the original nested structure.\n    \"\"\"\n    flattened_result = []\n    for element in nested_list:\n        if isinstance(element, list):\n            flattened_result.extend(flatten_list(element))\n        else:\n            flattened_result.append(element)\n    return flattened_result"}
