{"task_id": "Mbpp/409", "solution": "def min_product_tuple(list_of_tuples):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the minimum product from a list of two-element numerical tuples.\n    Assumes valid input structure as per the problem description.\n    \"\"\"\n    min_product = float('inf')\n\n    for current_tuple in list_of_tuples:\n        element1, element2 = current_tuple\n        current_product = element1 * element2\n        if current_product < min_product:\n            min_product = current_product\n\n    return min_product"}
