{"task_id": "Mbpp/448", "solution": "class PerrinCalculator:\n    \"\"\"Manages the calculation of Perrin numbers and their cumulative sum, including memoization.\"\"\"\n    def __init__(self):\n        # Initializes the calculator with base Perrin numbers in the memoization cache.\n        self._memo: dict[int, int] = {\n            0: 3, # P(0)\n            1: 0, # P(1)\n            2: 2  # P(2)\n        }\n\n    def calculate_perrin_number(self, n: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Calculates the Perrin number P(n) using memoization and the recursive definition.\"\"\"\n        if n in self._memo:\n            return self._memo[n]\n\n        # P(n) = P(n-2) + P(n-3)\n        val = self.calculate_perrin_number(n - 2) + self.calculate_perrin_number(n - 3)\n        self._memo[n] = val\n        return val\n\n    def calculate_sum(self, n: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Calculates the sum of Perrin numbers from P(0) to P(n) (inclusive).\"\"\"\n        total_sum = 0\n        for i in range(n + 1):\n            total_sum += self.calculate_perrin_number(i)\n        return total_sum\ndef cal_sum(N: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of Perrin numbers from P(0) to P(N) (inclusive).\n    Creates a PerrinCalculator instance and delegates the sum calculation to it.\n    \"\"\"\n    calculator = PerrinCalculator()\n    return calculator.calculate_sum(N)"}
