{"task_id": "Mbpp/733", "solution": "def find_first_occurrence(array: list, target: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the index of the first occurrence of a given number in a sorted array using binary search.\n    Returns -1 if the target number is not found.\n    \"\"\"\n    low = 0\n    high = len(array) - 1\n    result = -1\n\n    while low <= high:\n        mid = low + (high - low) // 2\n\n        if array[mid] == target:\n            result = mid  # Found an occurrence, store it as a potential first occurrence.\n            high = mid - 1  # Continue searching in the left half for an earlier occurrence.\n        elif array[mid] < target:\n            low = mid + 1  # Target is in the right half.\n        else:  # array[mid] > target\n            high = mid - 1  # Target is in the left half.\n\n    return result"}
