{"task_id": "Mbpp/734", "solution": "def sum_Of_Subarray_Prod(input_list: list) -> (int | float):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of products of all possible contiguous sublists of a given list.\n    The function iterates through all sublists, computes their product, and sums them up.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    n = len(input_list)\n\n    for i in range(n):\n        current_product = 1\n        for j in range(i, n):\n            current_product *= input_list[j]\n            total_sum += current_product\n    return total_sum"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/735", "solution": "def toggle_middle_bits(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Toggles all bits of an integer number except the first (MSB) and the last (LSB) bits.\n    Returns the new integer value after toggling the middle bits.\"\"\"\n    binary_string = bin(number)[2:]  # Remove '0b' prefix\n\n    if len(binary_string) <= 2:\n        return number\n\n    first_bit = binary_string[0]\n    last_bit = binary_string[-1]\n    middle_bits_string = binary_string[1:-1]\n\n    inverted_middle_bits = []\n    for bit in middle_bits_string:\n        inverted_middle_bits.append('1' if bit == '0' else '0')\n    \n    new_binary_string = first_bit + \"\".join(inverted_middle_bits) + last_bit\n    return int(new_binary_string, 2)"}
