{"task_id": "Mbpp/763", "solution": "def find_min_diff(array: tuple, size: int) -> int | float | None:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the minimum absolute difference between any two elements in a given array.\n\n    Returns the minimum absolute difference or None if the array contains fewer than two elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    if size < 2:\n        return None\n\n    sorted_array = sorted(array)\n\n    min_diff = float('inf')\n\n    for i in range(size - 1):\n        diff = abs(sorted_array[i+1] - sorted_array[i])\n        if diff < min_diff:\n            min_diff = diff\n\n    return min_diff"}
