{"task_id": "Mbpp/797", "solution": "def sum_in_range(l: int, r: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of all odd natural numbers within the inclusive range [l, r].\n    Natural numbers are positive integers (>= 1).\n    \"\"\"\n    current_sum = 0\n    if l > r:\n        return 0\n\n    # Ensure we start checking from at least 1, as natural numbers are positive integers.\n    start = max(1, l)\n\n    for num in range(start, r + 1):\n        if num % 2 != 0:  # Check if the number is odd\n            current_sum += num\n    return current_sum"}
