{"task_id": "Mbpp/801", "solution": "def test_three_equal(num1: int, num2: int, num3: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts the number of equal values among three given integers.\n    Returns 3 if all three are equal, 2 if exactly two are equal, and 0 otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    if num1 == num2 and num2 == num3:\n        return 3\n    elif num1 == num2 or num1 == num3 or num2 == num3:\n        return 2\n    else:\n        return 0"}
